0. Preamble, My Context

i. 	In my time in the myth community on Roblox, nearing 6 years (only heavily passionate in recent years), I have recognized a pattern for myself, a pattern of activity that has me disappear for many months at a time, only to return for a few months of extreme inspiration, all to disappear once more. I have also noted that every time I return, I find a new peak for myself both in my capabilities creatively, and in my connections within the community. This relates not only to me being a myth, but also as a hunter, as I have engaged with what feels like nearly every myth out there in my time in the community. It is in this most recent “phase” of my engagement in the community that I have built up a somewhat solid idea of how the community works and the people and groups within the community, as well as their wants. It is this recent bout of activity that I have fully reached the art that I had dreamt of for so long, and have connected far and wide within the community. With this new perspective, I believe my concept of the community has reached a nice enough point to officially write out in a document, whether there are readers or not, and whether it holds true or not.	
